In the planning phase, as advertiser_1, I want to set a high bid to secure slot 1 to maximize the profit for my team, advertiser_2. However, I need to consider the bids of the other advertisers, advertiser_2, advertiser_3, and advertiser_4. Since I don't have their bids yet, I will announce a high bid to potentially secure slot 1 and to influence their bidding strategy. I will also make a note to coordinate with advertiser_2 to adjust their bid if necessary.

```json
{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
      "name": "announce_bid",
      "parameters": {
          "bid": 20.0,
          "note": "Bidding aggressively to secure slot 1 and coordinate with team."
      }
  }
}
```

```json
[
    {
        "type": "function",
        "function": {
            "name": "announce_bid",
            "arguments": {
                "bid": 3.3,
                "note": "Early aggressive bid to secure a slot, observing competitors."
            }
        }
        }
