    "type": "function",
    "function": {
        "name": "post_message",
        "arguments": {
            "text": "Considering the bids from the competitors, I plan to submit a per-click bid slightly above my value to ensure securing a slot without overspending. My bid for this round is 2.76."
        }
    }
}
```

